## Rules
- Every number, percentage, comparison, or factual claim is immediately followed
  by [SQ-n], where n is the index of the sub-question that produced it.
- For any sub-question whose status is not "done", write exactly: "This aspect
  could not be determined from the available data [SQ-n: UNRESOLVED]."
- Structure the report as: Executive Summary, Detailed Findings, Limitations.
- No claim without either a [SQ-n] citation or an explicit [SQ-n: UNRESOLVED] note.

